libvpx (Google / The WebM Project)
----------------------------------

The arithmetic bool encoder in `src/bool_encoder.rs` is ported from
libvpx's `vp8_encode_bool` routine (and the surrounding boolean-coder
state machine in `vp8/encoder/boolhuff.{c,h}`). It implements the
same range-renormalisation and carry-propagation algorithm as the
reference encoder.

The coefficient token decoder in `src/tokens.rs` structurally mirrors
libvpx's `GetCoeffs()` function in `vp8/decoder/detokenize.c`,
including the branchy token-tree traversal, extra-bits handling, and
DCT-value reconstruction sequence used by the reference decoder.

The default coefficient, motion-vector, and related probability
tables in `src/default_probs.rs` are reproduced from the VP8 Data
Format specification (RFC 6386), which is a public standards
document. Those tables do not require libvpx attribution; they are
listed here only for clarity.

